OL,3,GNEWSARoman ruins found at school could
OL,4,Aadd #1m to repair bill
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe discovery of Roman ruins at a
OL,7,Fschool could add #1m to the
OL,8,Frefurbishment cost because of delays,
OL,9,Faccording to the council.
OL,11,FNewport City Council had approved plans
OL,12,Ffor a new sports and teaching block at
OL,13,FCaerleon Comprehensive School to create
OL,14,Fa "modern teaching environment" for
OL,15,Fstaff and pupils.
OL,17,FBut construction was paused in the
OL,18,Fsummer after the discovery of what was
OL,19,Fbelieved to be a Roman parade ground
OL,20,Fwall and road.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
